  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.1.1p2 (live)\nDescription of the bug:\nChanging networks while connected to a VRChat world does not successfully use the new network, and lags out instead.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): \nStep 1: Connect to a VRChat instance.\nStep 2: Change networks (from ethernet to wifi, between two wifi networks, etc.)\nAt this point, you can try using a web browser or something to demonstrate that you do in fact *have* an internet connection, but VRChat will lag out. \n(This happens to me fairly frequently given the nature of my network setup.)\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nOutput log of me doing this a couple times: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tn8nQEco3sOorDVE51_kMqc1YmQFrX-c/view?usp=sharing",
